; ------------------------------------------------------------ the interpreter
; M68kRun(n): execute until at least n clock cycles are spent. Returns the
; cycles used; returns early when the CPU stops (STOP) or halts.
Procedure.i M68kRun(n.i)
  Protected op.i, xo.i, ea.i, vs.i, vd.i, vr.i, t.i, u.i, x.i, y.i, rg.i
